        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Grafton%2C_Vermont"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Grafton once served as a notable stagecoach hub for travelers crossing the Green Mountains into Albany, New York.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        16
