      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Grafton%2C_Vermont"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Grafton Village Cheese is a modern continuation of the Grafton Cooperative Cheese Company, which was founded in 1892.",
